---
alwaysApply: false
description: Tapp SDK integration
---
Read the repository-root [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for integration and contributor instructions.

- Choose exactly one of tapp-capacitor-sdk or tapp-adjust-capacitor-sdk, never both.
- Call start() first and await completion before url(), handleTappEvent(), or link resolution; register listeners before startup.
- Wire the iOS Associated Domains entitlement and CODE_SIGN_ENTITLEMENTS, plus the Android autoVerify App Links intent filter.
- In CocoaPods mode, put tapp-so/Specs.git before cdn.cocoapods.org in ios/App/Podfile; include both sources.
- Never hard-code authToken or tappToken; load them from environment/configuration.

Use “device match” and “SHA-256 certificate hash”. Never log tokens.
